abstract: "Identifier-free per-item metrics, aggregate audit tables, agreement labels, and code for recalculating the credit-gap tables and core hierarchy-aware statistics. Recall at 5 is retained as a deposited aggregate. Terminology identifiers, identifier-linked description records, and ontology maps are not redistributed."
